  lectureTitle: Quest System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1583bb5d40c9cfc44abc46b3f4924c77, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Quest System that keeps track of active Quests and each Quest
    can have its own logic to have any kind of requirements.


    In this Scenario,
    there are 2 NPCs that the Player can interact with, each of them gives a different
    Quest. The Quests show up in the UI, one quest requires the player to pick up
    Apples and the other Quest requires the player to Walk.'
